{"4821570":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Otherworld Shards","steam_appid":4821570,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4958440,5306410],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Game Introduction<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic collapse split the ancient immortal world into countless fragments drifting through the empty void. Your starting island erodes endlessly, and only the <strong>Core of Shards<\/strong> can halt its annihilation. To survive, you must scout remote isles, open void portals, defeat island lords and absorb their territory and resources. As you gather more world shards, the hidden truths behind the apocalypse gradually surface, pushing you toward the ultimate goal: mending the fractured heaven and earth and reforging a whole immortal world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/extras\/22d60b76ab4488e997c8a48c667db01d.avif?t=1793666227\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/extras_big\/22d60b76ab4488e997c8a48c667db01d.avif?t=1793666227 width=1560 height=1014 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Core Gameplay Features<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Five-Element Combat<\/strong><br>Master the spells of Gold, Wood, Water, Fire and Earth, enhanced by Lightning, Ice and Wind variants. Each cultivator can only wield the element of their nature, but with six freely combinable skill slots — area attacks, single-target executions, imprisoning fields and more — you forge your own combat style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nayin-Blessed Disciples System<\/strong><br>Recruit over thirty types of disciples inspired by traditional Nayin five-element astrology, each with innate traits and unique passive talents. The hero is immortal thanks to the Core of Shards, but a disciple who falls in battle won't return on their own — only a rare resurrection pill can bring them back, making every expedition a life-or-death choice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Immortal Sect Building<\/strong><br>Develop your floating base by raising scripture pavilions, alchemy labs, forges, spirit-gathering arrays and training arenas. Build out your production chain, craft your own artifacts and elixirs, and unlock the island-steering formation to sail your entire island toward dangerous, resource-rich regions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Endgame Dungeons<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Tower<\/strong> — climb nine layers where beasts grow stronger with every floor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss<\/strong> — descend into the depths where the ultimate boss and world secrets await.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Labyrinth<\/strong> — a randomly generated map full of mechanisms to solve in search of ancient treasures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Grand Tournament<\/strong> — a 32-competitor single-elimination bracket to crown the strongest cultivator of the void and claim exclusive titles and rare rewards.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragment Lore Unlocking<\/strong><br>Every conquered island unlocks a piece of the forgotten past. The memory shards scattered across the dungeons gradually piece together the truth of the apocalypse, the origin of the Core of Shards and the secret behind the fall of the ancient immortals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Core Survival Pressure<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void corrodes your floating islands without pause: their stability steadily drains, and at regular intervals every island on the map resets its position. Standing still leads only to collapse — constant conquest, expansion, shard-collecting and strengthening your sect are the only way to fulfill your destiny of remaking the immortal world before everything sinks into the void.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Otherworld Shards<\/strong> to your wishlist, guard your drifting homeland, and reshape a whole new immortal world from countless scattered shards.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Game Introduction<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A catastrophic collapse split the ancient immortal world into countless fragments drifting through the empty void. Your starting island erodes endlessly, and only the <strong>Core of Shards<\/strong> can halt its annihilation. To survive, you must scout remote isles, open void portals, defeat island lords and absorb their territory and resources. As you gather more world shards, the hidden truths behind the apocalypse gradually surface, pushing you toward the ultimate goal: mending the fractured heaven and earth and reforging a whole immortal world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/extras\/22d60b76ab4488e997c8a48c667db01d.avif?t=1793666227\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/extras_big\/22d60b76ab4488e997c8a48c667db01d.avif?t=1793666227 width=1560 height=1014 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Core Gameplay Features<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Five-Element Combat<\/strong><br>Master the spells of Gold, Wood, Water, Fire and Earth, enhanced by Lightning, Ice and Wind variants. Each cultivator can only wield the element of their nature, but with six freely combinable skill slots — area attacks, single-target executions, imprisoning fields and more — you forge your own combat style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nayin-Blessed Disciples System<\/strong><br>Recruit over thirty types of disciples inspired by traditional Nayin five-element astrology, each with innate traits and unique passive talents. The hero is immortal thanks to the Core of Shards, but a disciple who falls in battle won't return on their own — only a rare resurrection pill can bring them back, making every expedition a life-or-death choice.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Immortal Sect Building<\/strong><br>Develop your floating base by raising scripture pavilions, alchemy labs, forges, spirit-gathering arrays and training arenas. Build out your production chain, craft your own artifacts and elixirs, and unlock the island-steering formation to sail your entire island toward dangerous, resource-rich regions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Endgame Dungeons<\/strong><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Tower<\/strong> — climb nine layers where beasts grow stronger with every floor.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss<\/strong> — descend into the depths where the ultimate boss and world secrets await.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Labyrinth<\/strong> — a randomly generated map full of mechanisms to solve in search of ancient treasures.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Grand Tournament<\/strong> — a 32-competitor single-elimination bracket to crown the strongest cultivator of the void and claim exclusive titles and rare rewards.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragment Lore Unlocking<\/strong><br>Every conquered island unlocks a piece of the forgotten past. The memory shards scattered across the dungeons gradually piece together the truth of the apocalypse, the origin of the Core of Shards and the secret behind the fall of the ancient immortals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ Core Survival Pressure<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void corrodes your floating islands without pause: their stability steadily drains, and at regular intervals every island on the map resets its position. Standing still leads only to collapse — constant conquest, expansion, shard-collecting and strengthening your sect are the only way to fulfill your destiny of remaking the immortal world before everything sinks into the void.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>Otherworld Shards<\/strong> to your wishlist, guard your drifting homeland, and reshape a whole new immortal world from countless scattered shards.<\/p>","short_description":"Otherworld Shards is a xianxia action RPG with floating-island building. Saved by the Core of Shards, you explore void isles, fight in real time, recruit unique Nayin disciples, build your sect and rebuild the broken immortal realm.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Russian, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/11b3ccc83c558d0f29ae209e391b068711776cdf\/header.jpg?t=1793666227","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/b59fd667068548cd8381b92feec9a9fd518223f0\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793666227","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4821570\/b59fd667068548cd8381b92feec9a9fd518223f0\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793666227","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8000 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 (4 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-9700 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16000 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super \/ AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 20000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX <\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["loveveryb"],"publishers":["loveveryb"],"demos":[{"appid":5306410,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":969,"final":969,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"9,69€"},"packages":[1675363],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Otherworld Shards","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1675363,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Otherworld Shards - 9,69€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":969}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/ap